              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyah 8:7-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bamarayika bane, bari biteguriwe iyo saha n’uwo musi n’ukwo kwezi n’uwo mwaka, babohorerwa kwica ikigira gatatu c’abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igitigiri c’ingabo z’abarwanira ku mafarasi car’ ibihumbi amajana igihumbi kabiri: igitigiri cabo naracumvise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nerekwa ntya amafarasi n’abari bayicayeko. Bari bambaye ivyuma bikīngira ibikiriza, bisa n’ikibengebenge n’agafyiri n’amazuku: imitwe y’ayo mafarasi yari nk’iy’ intambge, mu kanwa kayo havamw’ umuriro n’umwotsi n’amazuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikigira gatatu c’abantu cicwa n’ivyo vyago, ukw ari bitatu, umuriro n’umwotsi n’amazuku, bivuye mu kanwa kayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ ububasha bg’ayo mafarasi buri mu kanwa kayo no mu mirizo yayo: kukw imirizo yayo imeze nk’inzoka, na yo iri n’imitwe, kandi ni yo aryanisha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
