        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bārokotse, batishwe n’ivyo vyago, ntibihana ivyakozwe n’intoke zabo, ngo bareke gusenga abadayimoni n’ibigirwamana vy’izahabu n’ivy’ ifeza n’ivy’ imiringa n’ivy’ amabuye n’ivy’ ibiti, bidashobora kubona canke kwumva canke kugenda: ",
